      "content": "You should absolutely stop taking those supplements immediately and contact your nephrologist, as potassium levels in stage 3 kidney disease can be dangerously unstable.\nYour symptoms of fluttering and tingling are classic signs of hyperkalemia, which can lead to fatal arrhythmias if you try to \"force\" your body to absorb more potassium.\nDo not attempt to self-treat or adjust dosages, as your kidneys cannot safely process the extra load you are proposing.",
