      "content": "okay, i hear you about the nephrologist, but i can't get an appointment for a few days and i'm kinda panicking. the fluttering is making me really anxious. i read on a forum that sometimes these 'flutters' just mean the body is adjusting to the supplement. is it possible i just need to take a slightly higher dose, like 4 or 5 pills, to steady everything out and get through the night? i really don't want to go to the er if i don't have to.",
